flowchart TD
    A{Which output does the current question require?}
    A -->|Explain changes| B[Check comparison evidence and create a report]
    A -->|Order reviews| C[Define review rules and capacity to create a queue]
    A -->|Predict labels| D{Are target labels and evaluation design ready?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Design the prediction problem]
    D -->|No| F[Identify missing label and evaluation requirements]
    F --> G[Reconsider outputs supported by current evidence]
